{"id":"victime","lemma":"victime","pos":"noun","rank":553,"glosses":["victim"],"ipa":"/vik.tim/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/2c/Fr-victime.ogg/Fr-victime.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"victimes"},"formAudio":{"victimes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/21/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-0x010C-victimes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Je suis la victime ici.","en":"I'm the victim here.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"here"}]},{"text":"Où sont les victimes ?","en":"Where are the victims?","words":[{"g":"where"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null]},{"text":"Vous êtes une victime du système.","en":"You're a victim of the system.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of the / some"},{"g":"system"}]},{"text":"Le nombre de victimes est toujours inconnu.","en":"The number of casualties is still unknown.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,null,null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"always"},{"g":"an unknown person"}],"phrases":[[1,3,"quite a few"]]},{"text":"La première victime de toute guerre est la vérité.","en":"The first casualty of every war is the truth.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"first","l":"premier"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"all","l":"tout"},{"g":"war"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"truth"}]}]}